              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Abuneri aja inama n’ abakuru bo mu Bisirayeli, aravuga, ati Mumaze igihe kitari gito mugomba ko Dawidi yoba umwami wanyu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
