        },
        {
          "text": "none rero ni mubirāngūre; kuk’ Uhoraho yavuze ivya Dawidi, ng’ Umusavyi wiwe Dawidi ni we azokiza abantu biwe Abisirayeli, abakūre mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya no mu y’abansi babo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
