              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abuneri abibarira n’ Ababenyamini na bo. Bukeye aja i Heburoni, kugira ngo yīgānire Dawidi ivyo Abisirayeli n’ab’ umuryango w’Ababenyamini bose bamaramaje gukora vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw ashitse i Heburoni kwa Dawidi, ari kumwe n’abantu mirongwibiri, Dawidi amurondereza amazimano bo n’abari kumwe na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
