          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yowabu n’abantu ba Dawidi baragaruka bavuye gutera, bazanye iminyago myinshi; ariko Abuneri ntiyar’ akiri kumwe na Dawidi i Heburoni, kuko yar’ amaze kumurekura, yīgīriye amahoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yowabu n’ingabo ziwe zose bagishika bartya, babarira Yowabu, bati Abuneri mwene Neri yamanye n’umwami, non’ umwami yamurekuye, yīgīriye amahoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yowabu aragenda abaza umwami, ati Wakoze ibiki? Abuneri ngo yamanye nawe, uraheza uramureka arīgīra? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ntuzi yuko Abuneri mwene Neri yazanywe no kuguhenda, ngw amenye ingen’ utabara n’ ingen’ utabaruka, amenye n’ivy’ ukora vyose? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yowabu, amaze kwikebanura Dawidi, akurikiza intumwa Abuneri; zimugarurira kw iriba ry’i Sira; ariko Dawidi ntiyabimenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
