              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Abuneri ashitse i Heburoni, Yowabu amwihererana hagati y’ amarembo, nk’ūgira abonane na we ata wumva; araheza amucumita ku nda, agwaho, amuhōye amaraso ya murumuna we Asaheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
