          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Dawidi avyumvise, aravuga, ati Twe n’igihugu canje turacuna imbere y’Uhoraho kur’ ayo maraso ya Abuneri mwene Neri gushitsa ibihe vyose; ",
          "type": "text",
